{"seq": 259, "t_ms": 31262, "type": "review_note", "data": {"text": "- **Main caveat:** Coverage is only 0.033–0.227 across the sites cited, so every occupancy figure (e.g., 66.9%, 46.2%) rests on a small slice of the 56-day window. Rankings could shift with more data, and occupancy is not demand or capacity.\n- **Numbers:** All 44 checked numbers traced; none are untraced.\n- **Gap:** The report gives no basis for splitting the 20 new points, and the RISPARMIO cluster is an inference from the site names."}}
